WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Receive: a customer asks about delayed order #1042.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Investigate: link the order to a shipping record showing a missed connection and a revised Friday delivery estimate.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Prepare: draft a customer update grounded in the order and shipment records.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Review: a person checks the proposed wording and decides whether to approve or request a revision.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Handover: record a sample approval and prepare the case for follow-up. No external message is sent.
